BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 714 Td (# Nexus Technologies - General Remote Work & Workplace Guidelines) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 685 Td (SECTION 1: GENERAL FLEXIBLE WORK PRINCIPLES) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 664 Td (Nexus supports flexible work arrangements that balance individual autonomy with) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 651 Td (team collaboration. All eligible employees may participate in our hybrid working) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 638 Td (rhythm, coordinating with team leaders to establish collaborative anchor days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 609 Td (SECTION 2: WORKSPACE SETUP AND ERGONOMIC HEALTH) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 588 Td (Remote employees are expected to maintain a dedicated, distraction-free workspace.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 575 Td (Workstations should feature adequate lighting, stable high-speed broadband) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 562 Td (connection \(>50 Mbps download / 15 Mbps upload\), and an ergonomically sound chair) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 549 Td (and desk arrangement. Employees should take regular 5-minute screen breaks every) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 536 Td (hour.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 507 Td (SECTION 3: COMMUNICATION STANDARDS AND CORE HOURS) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 486 Td (To facilitate seamless collaboration across distributed teams, core working hours) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 473 Td (are established between 10:00 AM and 4:00 PM in the employee's local time zone.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 460 Td (Slack status should be kept current, and calendar availability should be) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 447 Td (maintained in Google Calendar.) Tj ET
